 to see that you're not a  one-dimensional character and that  there's more to learn about you then can  be discovered in a couple of minutes on  tape you need some more funny or  embarrassing stories ready to go but  there's nothing wrong with going back  over what you've already said and adding  elements answers here obviously you can  afford to be a little bit longer and  more descriptive to that same day you'll  likely be sent to Harley Street for a  psychometric evaluation to check if you  have any mental health issues which  might become agitated by being on the  show you'll also be given a medical  examination including the most  comprehensive STI check you've ever seen  and some booster shots for things like  tetanus if yours have lapsed it's a very  bizarre but oddly quite nice experience  then it's just a waiting game to receive  the call during this time the execs may  FaceTime you and chase up some more  questions about you that they want more  info on this is also the stage where ITV  will be running they're very thorough  background checks so if you've got that  sex tape lurking around  it may be surfacing soon and that's  about it if you get the faded call from  the execs then congratulations welcome  to love island you're in the villa  please pass go please collect 1 million  followers  loads of  and a super drug sponsorship on the way  past if you have any more questions  about the process please throw them in  the comments below and if you've learned  anything or enjoyed the video please  give it a thumbs up there is enough  content to fill the love island pool  coming out of the next few months so  press subscribe it would make me very  happy indeed if you want to hear about  what life is really like in the love  island villa then press here and watch  our podcast episode which explain all of  the secrets from behind the scenes  [Music]
 

